2. GELLO's franka_fr3_arm_controllers (Apache-2.0) -- impedance law, filter, default gains
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Ported from wuphilipp/gello_software (https://github.com/wuphilipp/gello_software),
commit 9fc8c26b6e1f6cbd278c0f8f05d0246e6903992c, directory ros2/src/franka_fr3_arm_controllers/:

  src/law.cpp (TrajectoryImpedanceLaw::update, steps 3 and 4), include/joint_controller/law.hpp
      <- src/joint_impedance_controller.cpp, JointImpedanceController::calculateTauDGains_
         (dq_filtered_ = (1 - k_alpha_) dq_filtered_ + k_alpha_ dq_;
          tau = k_gains_ .* (q_goal - q_) + d_gains_ .* (-dq_filtered_)) and on_activate
         (dq_filtered_ zeroed at start);
  src/params.cpp, include/joint_controller/params.hpp (defaults)
      <- config/controllers.yaml (k_gains, d_gains, k_alpha) and
         include/franka_fr3_arm_controllers/joint_impedance_controller.hpp (kJointStateTimeout,
         the command_timeout_s default).

  Copyright (c) 2025 Franka Robotics GmbH
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (the "License"); you may not use these files
  except in compliance with the License. A copy of the License is in LICENSE.Apache-2.0 (verbatim
  from that directory). Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software
  distributed under the License is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR
  CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND, either express or implied.

  Changes: re-expressed without ROS 2 on Eigen for franky's torque loop; the goal q_goal is the
  quintic reference q_ref instead of the raw GELLO joint state; the coriolis term and the
  torque-rate limit are added (new code, section 1).

  NOTICE of the original directory:
    franka_fr3_arm_controllers
    Copyright 2025 Franka Robotics GmbH

3. franka_ros franka_description (Apache-2.0) -- joint position limits
----------------------------------------------------------------------
The Panda / FR3 joint position limits (frankaJointPositionLimits in src/params.cpp, the
lower_limit / upper_limit defaults of default_params) are the values of frankaemika/franka_ros
(https://github.com/frankaemika/franka_ros) @ ddd2fff,
franka_description/robots/{panda,fr3}/joint_limits.yaml (the same tables serl_controller uses).
Copyright (c) Franka Robotics GmbH (formerly Franka Emika GmbH), Apache License 2.0
(LICENSE.Apache-2.0).

4. Build-time dependencies (not included)
-----------------------------------------
franky (TimSchneider42/franky, v2.0.0, MIT), libfranka (frankarobotics/libfranka, Apache-2.0),
pybind11 (BSD-3-Clause), Eigen (MPL-2.0) and doctest (MIT, tests only) are used unmodified and
are not part of this package's sources; the franky wheel built alongside carries its own licences.
